[{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"["}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". It is guaranteed that the string is non-empty and its length doesn't exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"105"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line print a single integer — the number of brackets «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"["}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» in the required bracket sequence. In the second line print the optimal sequence. If there are more than one optimal solutions print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"([])\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n([])\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"(((\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},